#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601416"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601520"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601656"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601700"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601840"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601960"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602060"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602252"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602316"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602396"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602512"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602640"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602684"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602812"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602940"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603048"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603136"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603228"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603376"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603460"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603592"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603692"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603852"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "603980"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604072"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604204"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604304"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604512"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604636"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604768"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604860"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604984"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605064"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605168"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605256"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "605376"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "605460"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "605540"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "605608"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "605648"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "605680"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. popupStd
msgctxt "605712"
msgid "Return to the previous floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "605744"
msgid "Return to previous floor."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "605772"
msgid "Return to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605800"
msgid "I stand before the final wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605832"
msgid "Beyond this is the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605888"
msgid "That's where #C236196003BB#CDEF awaits us; where we'll finish our fight.\nFrom an observation installation, the Core transformed into a\nmanagement installation; no longer a God's brain,\nbut a devil's brain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606096"
msgid "Up ahead is a \"present\" that has yet to occur."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606144"
msgid "If we defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF and return the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF to normal,\nthe \"future\" outside will become one where humanity's\ndestruction will be postponed rather than decided."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606336"
msgid "If #C236196003BB#CDEF defeats us, then it's all over.\nAll elements of the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF that\ncould hope to stop #C236196003BB#CDEF will be extinguished."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606512"
msgid "That instant will confirm a future where\n\"in seven days, humanity will fall to ruin.\"\nIt will then become immutable \"truth\" ―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606644"
msgid "So, let's have one last check."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606676"
msgid "The reason why I'm here, heading into these depths is:"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "606732"
msgid "For the correct future."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "606756"
msgid "……for Sakura's sake."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "606780"
msgid "……for Sakura's sake.#C246168255薗#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606824"
msgid "For the correct future."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606848"
msgid "There are also other reasons, but this is the most important."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606912"
msgid "You at #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's wall? Figures, but while we\ncan't get any visuals over the Central Region,\nwe can get a sense of positioning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607056"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF―――We'll let you take over\nfrom here, right? Please release the wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607152"
msgid "Yes, of course. You all cleared the condition\nI put forward. I need only to carry out my end."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607248"
msgid "I take a deep breath and touch the final wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607296"
msgid "C-contact, has been confirmed―――\n#ROFS-006#RUBSRedefining mental sculpture   #RUBEReforming statue#REND around psychoanalysis,\nbehaviorism, and humanistic psychology…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607468"
msgid "*kgh*… defining, complete. Sakura model\nAI mental figure and declaration―――\nDisassembling via equivalent authority―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607596"
msgid "This wall in the shape of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is being disassembled…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607672"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF sounds like she's enduring some pain.\nSince this wall is \"#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind,\" this means―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607804"
msgid "There's probably no coming back from that space.\nA one-way only trip to the Core.\nOnce you enter, you'll get sucked in."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607924"
msgid "In some sense, the laws of that area follow\nsimilar rules to that of an #C000246204Observed Universe#CDEF.\nTime progresses in one direction."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608068"
msgid "This will be our final transmission…\nI wish you good luck in your battle. We'll be\nin the Near Side before you get there."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608192"
msgid "There you have it.\nSorry, but we'll be putting ourselves a\nstep ahead of you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608272"
msgid "Once we confirm that you're in, we'll be\nsending you all the power source we have.\nThat should make things a bit easier for you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608404"
msgid "Alright. This is our last transmission.\nKeep your head straight.\nNo screwing up in the last leg of all this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608516"
msgid "…I can no longer hear any voice transmissions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608564"
msgid "Waves of quasi-Spiritrons flooding out\nof the Core are disrupting all observation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608648"
msgid "I don't know if they can monitor me here,\nbut I nod to #C236196003Rin#CDEF and #C236196003Rani#CDEF \"Leave it to me.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608768"
msgid "The final door opens.\nThe flow of time surges toward the conclusion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608840"
msgid "Save… me?\n…I don't understand what you mean.\nYou still insist on that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608916"
msgid "…rather, deletions need to take place.\nUnless #C236196003BB#CDEF is deleted and then me,\nthis predicament won't be settled."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609044"
msgid "Please defeat #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nI'll transfer control to myself afterwards."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609124"
msgid "If I gain access rights to the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nfor just a moment, I should be able to\nmake everything like it never happened―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609268"
msgid "Let me get this straight… The instant you\nbecome the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF, you'll reset everything\nthat happened here in the #C000246204Far Side#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609428"
msgid "Yes. Once #C236196003BB#CDEF's systems are down,\nshe'll be flagged as non-compliant\nmanagement software."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609536"
msgid "Then, the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will perform a\nlookup to find a new management software…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609632"
msgid "Inevitably, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF―being of the same model\nas #C236196003BB#CDEF―will be selected by the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF\nto serve as its brain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609788"
msgid "You'll disappear too. All the memories,\nexperiences, and emotions you had here\nwill all be zeroed out, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609904"
msgid "Now I've done it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609924"
msgid "I don't know where this irritation came from,\nbut without thinking, I slam my fist against the\nwall before me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610036"
msgid "It's not good for a #[gentleman][friend]# to act violent like this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610104"
msgid "It's not good, but #C236196003Sakura#CDEF went too far with what she said.\nI want her to forgive me just this once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610220"
msgid "I answered that \"I'm doing this for #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610284"
msgid "Everything she's saying is wrong.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is misunderstanding because she's making assumptions."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610396"
msgid "That can't happen.\nI swore to protect #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610460"
msgid "That's why―――I won't let #C236196003Sakura#CDEF or #C236196003BB#CDEF disappear."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610544"
msgid "W-why would you!? She's the little devil\nthat's been tormenting you, that brought\nabout this entire nightmare!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610656"
msgid "I will regardless.\nAnd sure, #C236196003BB#CDEF needs to be punished for what she's done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610748"
msgid "After all, they're both the same AI; she's also #C236196003Sakura#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610820"
msgid "That's the conclusion I came to,\nand I'm not changing my mind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610884"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF being #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's backup…\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's copy isn't the reason I want to save her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611012"
msgid "I can't abandon her because she's also #C236196003Sakura#CDEF,\nand I want to save her because she's #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611132"
msgid "The poor #C000246204Alter Egos#CDEF, split from #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nThey were determined to reach the Core,\nknowing they would be destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611276"
msgid "…yeah\nI've been concerned for #C236196003BB#CDEF for a long while now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611348"
msgid "I can't help but think she's not some AI gone rogue;\nshe's a single living being like me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611444"
msgid "…thank you very much.\n#C236196003BB#CDEF and I are different entities now, but―――\nI'm very happy right now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611556"
msgid "She has the mind that I don't have. So long\nas she has that mind, there's an even chance\nthat my Self will remain."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611672"
msgid "There should still be a chance to detach\n#C236196003BB#CDEF from the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF without deleting her.\nSo, Senpai―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611808"
msgid "I wholeheartedly reply that she can trust me to do so."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611864"
msgid "I have no interest in fighting #C236196003BB#CDEF.\nThis time, we won't meet as enemies―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611960"
msgid "I'll get through to #C236196003BB#CDEF,\njust by being plain old #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612060"
msgid "Not in terms of looks; in terms of personality.\n#C236196003Sakura#CDEF is a bit cold and calculating herself,\nand not just because she's an AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612204"
msgid "I agree. You can't call out someone\nas being logical and cold just because\nthey're an AI or a homunculus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612312"
msgid "That said, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF experienced and gained\nabout half of #C236196003BB#CDEF's wiles.\nI say she still has a way to go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612444"
msgid "T-that's right!\nA normal amount for any girl, right, Senpai!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612508"
msgid "………\nI'll refrain from saying that having\nhalf of #C236196003BB#CDEF's coldheartedness is plenty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612608"
msgid "Yeah. And we still don't know why\nshe made a backup and what contents\nwere in the backup."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612700"
msgid "\"Why\"? Condemning you won't solve anything,\nplus, you're a member of the Student Council.\nIt's not your fault anyway, right, #C236196003Rani#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612848"
msgid "Correct. AI don't have the freedom to\ncommit wrongdoings. They also don't have\nthe freedom to make mistakes. Therefore――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "612972"
msgid "There you have it.\nWell, it also bugs me that she didn't\ndiscuss this with us before…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613060"
msgid "I'll let it slide because of what you just said.\nThat whole, \"I'll place my bets on you.\"\nYou're thinking like a human now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613184"
msgid "Thinking like a teenager at that,\nthe kind that writes \"XOXO.\" We have to help\nyou out after hearing this."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613292"
msgid "We'll persuade #C236196003BB#CDEF without beating her down.\nAfter that, we'll get to cracking\nthe #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613424"
msgid "Sounds fun, I say. Not something a\ndecent hacker would choose to do, but we can\npretend to be nice people like you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613540"
msgid "The entire dark corridor quakes for a moment,\nas if #C236196003Sakura#CDEF's mind itself were shaking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613644"
msgid "Time to start our actual final job. To be\nhonest, we were planning on going our separate\nways now, but there's been a change of plans."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613780"
msgid "The Student Council will be supporting\nyou until the very end, #C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF.\nPlease stay safe!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613888"
msgid "I apologize for this,\nbut I'll have my say, too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613940"
msgid "The final door opens.\nThe flow of time surges toward the conclusion."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614012"
msgid "Let's back away from the wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614044"
msgid "We run through the empty space.\nThis space makes you feel like you're going nowhere,\nbut I have a hunch that there's definitely an \"exit\"\nahead of us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614196"
msgid "Just a little further."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614220"
msgid "\"If we can get out of this darkness,\nwe'll reach our destination.\"\nAnd I soon as I had that thought, it appeared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614336"
msgid "What the―!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614352"
msgid "What is this!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614368"
msgid "Is this… no way―― A Labyrinth Core…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614412"
msgid "That's―――It can't be―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614444"
msgid "―――I get why #C236196003Sakura#CDEF is at a loss for words."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614508"
msgid "Appearing before us is a sculpture of #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\n…no, of #C236196003BB#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614600"
msgid "The #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF itself was #C236196003BB#CDEF's\nmental imagery space this entire time!?\nHave we been going down #C236196003BB#CDEF's mind!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614764"
msgid "…it's reasonable to assume so.\nI also have a small detail to add:\n#C236196003BB#CDEF isn't inside of that wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614880"
msgid "That there is a husk―――\nIt's simply a physical barrier.\nEntry is not possible."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614964"
msgid "T-that makes sense, since the Labyrinth itself\nis #C236196003BB#CDEF's mind… But how will we break it down?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615076"
msgid "The structural integrity of this thing is\nno joke. No driver's getting into that thing…\nIt may be sturdier than the Core's barrier."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615212"
msgid "Check it out for the time being, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF.\nDamn it, #C236196003BB#CDEF… I didn't think she'd have\nan ace like this up her sleeve…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615360"
msgid "We won't be able to destroy it.\nUnfortunately, I think our only option may\nbe to find a different route."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615468"
msgid "U-umm, I'm telling you that this is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615508"
msgid "…taking up #C236196003Rin#CDEF's suggestion,\nI examine the remarkably giant wall."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615592"
msgid "Fundamentally, it's just like the other \"Cores,\"\nbut it lacks the warmth of life in it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615680"
msgid "Like #C236196003Rani#CDEF said, #C236196003BB#CDEF doesn't seem to be inside of this thing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615772"
msgid "This \"mind\" has long since gone cold.\nThat's what makes it similar to a billion year-old\nslumbering fossil."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615880"
msgid "Attention #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF――All Fictional\nSpiritron Pit functional, thinking beings: Core\ncontrol has been taken by an advanced AI."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616036"
msgid "Henceforth, the #C000246204Moon Cell Automaton#CDEF shall\nmigrate from the monitoring of humanity to the\ncontrol and management of humanity."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616180"
msgid "W-what did she say…!?\nNo! Did we not make it in time!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616236"
msgid "But there weren't any signs that it happened.\nSure, there IS this wall blocking the way,\nbut the Core is right here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616356"
msgid "An estimated 5,961,600 real-time seconds have\nelapsed since #RUBS my #RUBE#C236196003BB#CDEF's#REND request was accepted.\nEvent selection is now complete."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616512"
msgid "―――Is that #C236196003BB#CDEF's voice?\nThe tone is different for sure,\nbut it has the characteristics of #C236196003BB#CDEF's voice."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616648"
msgid "What she's saying makes no sense, though.\n5,961,600 seconds… 86,400 seconds in a day,\nso dividing gives 69…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616760"
msgid "The space itself is shaking… but aside from that,\nI'm also being driven by a mysterious impulse coming\nfrom inside of me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616884"
msgid "\n\n―――I'm scared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616904"
msgid "What primordial fear this is?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616936"
msgid "Being here scares me. Hearing that voice scares me.\nGauging the situation scares me. Facing reality scares me.\nLooking back at the past scares me.\nLooking into the future scares me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617120"
msgid "#C255045045No matter what I do, it's all      now.\nAnd comprehending #ROFS-003#RUBS   this moment#RUBEthe present#REND from the bottom of my\nheart scares me…!#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617288"
msgid "…I figured as much… So that's how it is, huh?\n―――Run, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617372"
msgid "We can't fight #C236196003BB#CDEF at this poi――\nNo, we were never any match to begin with!\nThis was decided from the very beginning――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617512"
msgid "And while I've had ownership,\nthere is no evidence that I ever allowed\nintruders in this area."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617608"
msgid "I shall delete these bugs to rectify this\ninconsistency. Now looking up the intruders\nwho have reached the Sakura Veil Grande."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617736"
msgid "Individual's name: #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nServant, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617820"
msgid "Individual's name: #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nServant, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617904"
msgid "Individual's name: #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nServant, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617988"
msgid "Individual's name: #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF.\nServant, #C236196003#SVT#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618072"
msgid "This is bad! We're going back, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND!\nWhat's wrong!?\nWhy won't you move? Run, hurry!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618184"
msgid "Not good! She's going to #RUBS    delete #RUBEincinerate#REND this\nentire space! What's the matter!?\nWhy are you spacing out!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618312"
msgid "Damn! I think she's going for a nation-building\nlevel #RUBS   Delete All#RUBEfull sweep#REND! Let's flee, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!\n…huh, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618492"
msgid "The tides #RUBS  the great collapse#RUBEof Napishtim #RENDdraw near…!\nRetreat, Master! The entire space will be\ndeleted! Grr, has fear consumed you, fool!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618652"
msgid "I'm scared. I'm scared. I'm scared. I'm scared."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618700"
msgid "My body won't move.\nI'm too afraid―my limbs have been lopped off at the base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618780"
msgid "#C080080080But what's so scary? Obviously you'll be scared.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618848"
msgid "#C080080080confronting a god as a human is scary.\nHearing a god declare that they're going to erase you is scary.#CDEF"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618968"
msgid "…no, that's not it. Something like that isn't scary."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619024"
msgid "This fear is really disgust.\nSomething that's become the #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF should\nnot be \"speaking in human.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619144"
msgid "…that's right. It's not that #RUBS    I  #RUBEhumans#REND fear god―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619220"
msgid "It's repulsive to see a god―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619252"
msgid "Hurry up and run! If you get deleted,\nit really will be all over for us!\nWe won't even have a chance to recoup!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619364"
msgid "The forced extraction won't execute in time!\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, hurry…!"
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "619444"
msgid "Continue to the next floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "619472"
msgid "Continue to the next floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619500"
msgid "No more detours.\nNow, to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF.\n――――For the correct future!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "619596"
msgid "Keep pushing through the Corridor!\nThe Core is just up ahead!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "619660"
msgid "There's the entrance!\nWe're almost to the Core!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "619708"
msgid "Darling, we've finally reached the entrance!\nEscape this imaginary number space and reach the Core!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "619808"
msgid "So, we've finally arrived. Stay focused.\nThe one behind everything is lurking inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619896"
msgid "I felt an intense light for an instant.\nI reopen my eyes to find darkness all around me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619988"
msgid "This is the end of the #C000246204Far Side of the Moon#CDEF…\nThe #C000246204Moon Cell's Central Region#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620100"
msgid "It's dark and cold, but I'm not scared. I feel lukewarm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620160"
msgid "I hear the echo of creaking that reminds me of a heartbeat."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620220"
msgid "This isn't like the \"end of the Labyrinth\"\nthat we've seen many times before."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620300"
msgid "This place has a similar structure to the Labyrinth,\nbut it's not the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF.\nIt's a \"#C000246204road to the Moon Cell's Core#CDEF\" made of Labyrinth parts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620484"
msgid "Lonely, isn't it? I expected our zenith path\nto be littered with roses…\nOh, well. I won't ask for much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620592"
msgid "Let's make haste, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND.\nNothing can surprise us at this point.\nWe'll simply press on, together!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620716"
msgid "…what an odd space. It feels like it stretches\non forever, yet it also feels like there's a\nwall in front of us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620832"
msgid "…it goes all the way to the end.\nLet's hurry, Master.\nWe don't have time to be standing around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620932"
msgid "Hm, this seems both familiar yet unfamiliar.\nThis smell has a mixture of death and life in\nit… This road is the kind that leads to hell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621072"
msgid "Which means, this may be that one path, right?\nIf memory serves, this is #RUBS    Yomotsu Hirasaka#RUBEthe Hirasaka#REND, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621200"
msgid "Hrrmm. My mother was the original yandere\nso I don't really want to go through here,\nbut we can't afford to wait around."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621324"
msgid "Let's go, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!\nThis straight path will be the last one we take!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621416"
msgid "It would seem this place is\na threshold between death and birth.\nIt reminds me of#RUBS            Kigal#RUBE the underworld#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621548"
msgid "This will also be my first time going to\nthe Core. There seems to be no danger, but this\nspace is like a cloth with frayed threads."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "621680"
msgid "We don't have the luxury of dallying about.\nWe'll race through this road while there's\nstill a road to tread."
msgstr ""

